# ── baked fonts are NOT committed ──────────────────────────────────────────
# They are derivatives of Noto Sans SC (SIL OFL). Redistributing a 3.8 MB
# rasterised subset adds a licensing question for no benefit: the baker and the
# exact recipe are in studio/tools/bake_font.py, so anyone can reproduce it
# byte-for-byte in one command. See docs/build-and-deploy.md.
*.fnt
references/fonts/

# ── firmware NEVER goes in this repo ───────────────────────────────────────
# Modified proprietary Porsche firmware. Same rule as porsche-pcm31-mods.
*.ifs
*.decomp
PCM3Root*
PCM3Reload*
firmware-cache/
